---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About vhsgreed" description="Transparency statement, headquarters, funding model, contact, and privacy policy for vhsgreed.">
  <div class="container">
    <section class="hero">
      <h1>About</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        One man operation.
      </p>
    </section>

    <hr class="rule" />

    <section class="prose">

      <h2>Headquarters</h2>
      <p>
        Stockholm, Sweden. We work across a small fleet: this site, the
        data pipelines, and the research runs all live on machines we own.
      </p>

      <h2>Funding model</h2>
      <p>
        Revenue comes from what we sell: data product, custom
        scraping and automation scripts, and research. That revenue funds the
        research and development. We do not take outside investment, and we do not run ads.
      </p>

      <h2>How we work</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Everything we claim is tested and verified.</li>
        <li>Honesty over hype.</li>
        <li>Links to our open source repositories and articles are on this <a href="/site-index/">site</a>, <a href="https://medium.com/@vhsgreed">Medium</a> and <a href="https://github.com/vhsgreed">GitHub.</a></li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        <a href="mailto:lillerik.sund@gmail.com">lillerik.sund@gmail.com</a>
        <br />
        <span class="muted">Do you want to get in touch? Do not hesitate to reach out.</span>
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>